---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="about" description="Who is xưn and why this blog exists.">
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="about-portrait" aria-hidden="true">🔆</p>
    <h1>Hi, I'm <span class="hl">xưn</span>.</h1>
  </section>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      I build AI products for a living and collect lessons for fun — about
      technology, about people, and about the strange overlap between the two.
    </p>
    <p>
      This blog is my notebook in public. Roughly 40% of it is technical
      (code, tools, things that broke and what I learned fixing them), 40% is
      personal reflection, and 20% is short notes that don't deserve a whole
      essay but were still worth remembering.
    </p>
    <p>
      I write in a mix of English and Vietnamese — whichever language the
      thought arrived in.
    </p>
    <p>
      The name of this site is the filter for everything on it: if future-me
      wouldn't want to remember it, it doesn't get published.
    </p>
    <h2>elsewhere</h2>
    <p>
      <!-- TODO: replace with your real links -->
      You can find me on <a href="#">GitHub</a> or say hi by
      <a href="#">email</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
